Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.04,0:00:05.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}《克拉克森的农场》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.20,0:00:08.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}《第三十四集 风暴来袭》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.24,0:00:11.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（拯救英国农业）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.60,0:00:12.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（没农场 没食物）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.80,0:00:44.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's easy to be distracted by stuff you see on the farm.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.80,0:00:44.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}在农场里 你很容易 被眼前的东西分散注意力
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.80,0:00:46.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Barn owls especially.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.80,0:00:46.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}尤其是仓鸮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.52,0:00:55.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But the fact is, I had two big jobs on my to-do list.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.52,0:00:55.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但事实上 我的待办事项清单上 有两项重大任务
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.36,0:01:01.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Number one, work out how we'd celebrate Christmas at the pub.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.36,0:01:01.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}第一项 想好我们如何 在酒吧庆祝圣诞节
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.44,0:01:04.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And number two,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.44,0:01:04.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}第二项…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.44,0:01:09.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}decide what to do about the London rally
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.44,0:01:09.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}决定要不要参加农民们
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.76,0:01:12.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}that was being planned by farmers to protest
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.76,0:01:14.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}为抗议预算案 而计划在伦敦举行的集会
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.92,0:01:14.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}about the budget.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.88,0:01:20.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This march...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.88,0:01:20.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这场游行
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.76,0:01:23.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Next week, Tuesday.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.76,0:01:23.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}下周二
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.16,0:01:25.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The question is,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.16,0:01:25.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}问题在于
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.00,0:01:26.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}do we go?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.00,0:01:26.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“我们要不要去？”
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.92,0:01:29.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Because if it turns ugly, people start flinging,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.92,0:01:29.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为如果局势变得难看
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.84,0:01:32.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- you know, some... - Wellies or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.84,0:01:32.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}有人开始乱扔东西 有些人会开始…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.52,0:01:34.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}...muck-spreaders and things and start covering public buildings in slurry
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.52,0:01:34.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 扔雨靴什么的 - …变成用粪肥撒播机之类的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.76,0:01:37.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}like the French do,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.76,0:01:37.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}开始像法国人那样 把粪肥泼满公共建筑
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.80,0:01:39.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}do you wanna be associated with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.80,0:01:39.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你想和那种事扯上关系吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.60,0:01:42.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And if you don't go,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.60,0:01:42.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}如果你不去
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.12,0:01:44.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}does it look like you're not backing the farmers?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.12,0:01:44.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}会不会显得你不支持…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.88,0:01:46.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh God...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.88,0:01:46.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}农民？天哪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.08,0:01:48.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I don't want to be in a riot.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.08,0:01:48.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我不想卷入骚乱
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.92,0:01:50.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Hmm... I don't wanna be in a riot.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.92,0:01:50.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我也不想卷入骚乱
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.56,0:01:55.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And, quite a few people are saying that I should make a speech.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.56,0:01:52.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而且有不少人说
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.92,0:01:54.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我应该发个言
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.80,0:01:58.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I mean, I'm gonna have to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.80,0:01:58.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我是说 我肯定得去
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.64,0:02:00.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I don't like big crowds and I'm literally gonna be in the middle of a big crowd.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.64,0:02:00.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我不喜欢人多的地方 而且我真的会
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.72,0:02:03.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm gonna be the worst person there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.72,0:02:03.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}身处一大群人的中间 我会是那里最差劲的人
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.36,0:02:06.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I don't mind a crowd, and it's nice to go down to London.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.36,0:02:06.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我不介意人群 而且 你知道 去伦敦也挺好的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.04,0:02:09.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'll be able to talk about Al Pacino and people will know what I'm on about.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.04,0:02:09.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我可以聊聊阿尔帕西诺 别人会明白我在说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.56,0:02:12.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.56,0:02:12.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那你去吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.52,0:02:14.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I think I'm going to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.52,0:02:14.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我觉得我会去
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.64,0:02:18.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Erm... And I'm gonna lay on a coach.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.64,0:02:18.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而且我会安排一辆大巴
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.72,0:02:20.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- I think that's a good idea. - So that if... Well.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.72,0:02:20.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我觉得这是个好主意 - 这样如果…有两个原因
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.76,0:02:23.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}For two reasons: one, it's a nice thing to do,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.76,0:02:23.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}第一 这是一件好事 而且…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.36,0:02:25.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and the other thing, this is for farmers to go to London.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.36,0:02:25.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这是为了让农民去伦敦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.68,0:02:28.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And the other is, if there's a coach going,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.68,0:02:28.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}另一个原因是 如果有一辆大巴去
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.16,0:02:31.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}it will stop a farmer taking a tractor and a muck-spreader.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.16,0:02:31.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那就能阻止某个农民 开着他的拖拉机和粪肥撒播机去
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.76,0:02:34.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}All right, I'll be on the bus then, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.76,0:02:34.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好吧 那我就坐大巴去了 没错
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.08,0:02:38.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And I'm going to make a decision on speaking kind of when I'm there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.08,0:02:36.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我到时候再决定发不发言
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.68,0:02:38.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}到了那里看情况吧 因为
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.48,0:02:41.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Because, you know, if you're standing in the middle of flares going off--
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.48,0:02:41.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你知道 如果你站在烟雾弹四起
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.52,0:02:42.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.52,0:02:44.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 粪浆乱飞的地方… - 嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.52,0:02:43.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And slurry being flung around the place...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.08,0:02:45.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You don't wanna be doing a speech then, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.08,0:02:45.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那时候可不适合发表讲话 对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.36,0:02:47.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- It's hasty-retreat time. - I'd be off then.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.36,0:02:47.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- …那就该赶紧撤退了…跟着… - 那我就会跑了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.96,0:02:49.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, you won't, cause you don't know your way around London.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.96,0:02:49.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你不会的 你对伦敦又不熟
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.72,0:02:51.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- No, I don't. I'll stick with you. - Stick with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.72,0:02:51.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 对 我不熟 我跟着你 - 跟着我
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.68,0:02:52.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.68,0:02:52.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.08,0:02:56.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Discussion over, Kaleb and I went to see
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.08,0:02:59.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}讨论结束 卡莱布和我 去看那些永远赶不拢的易养羊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.68,0:02:59.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}the un-roundup-able EasyCare sheep.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.56,0:03:00.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- How are you? - Morning. Very well, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.56,0:03:00.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你好吗？ - 早上好 很好 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.76,0:03:04.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Because the new EasyCare boyfriends were being delivered.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.76,0:03:04.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为它们的新易养羊男友要送到了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.04,0:03:07.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}They're mice! Why have I got two mice?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.04,0:03:07.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它们是老鼠 我怎么有两只老鼠？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.68,0:03:09.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Woolly mice.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.68,0:03:09.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 毛茸茸的老鼠 - 你…你
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.36,0:03:12.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Yeah... - Also, quite small testes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.36,0:03:12.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你总不想要大猛兽吧 - 而且 睾丸也挺小的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.32,0:03:15.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's only because it's cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.32,0:03:15.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}只是因为天冷
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.12,0:03:17.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.12,0:03:17.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.16,0:03:18.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你知道…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.08,0:03:21.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Once Kaleb had slathered their chests in marker paint
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.08,0:03:21.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}等卡莱布在它们的胸口涂上标记颜料
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.64,0:03:24.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}so we'd know which sheep they'd serviced,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.64,0:03:24.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好让我们知道它们配了哪些羊之后
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.52,0:03:27.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}the rams trotted off to meet the ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.52,0:03:27.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}公羊们就小跑着去见母羊们了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.44,0:03:32.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That one is tiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.44,0:03:32.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那只真小
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.92,0:03:35.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But again, you know, EasyCares are more feminine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.92,0:03:35.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但还是那句话 易养羊嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.36,0:03:38.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}They don't look like your average really big rams.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.36,0:03:38.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它们更秀气一些 看起来不像那种普通的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.24,0:03:43.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I then told Louise that one of the ewes had died.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.24,0:03:40.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 特别大的公羊 - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.56,0:03:43.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后我告诉路易丝 有一只母羊死了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.68,0:03:47.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And she had a rather surprising theory about why.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.68,0:03:47.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}她对此有一个相当出人意料的说法
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.28,0:03:49.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.28,0:03:49.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你知道吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.52,0:03:54.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What I think, I maybe left the sister or something at home
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.52,0:03:54.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我想我可能 把它的姐妹什么的留在家里了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.08,0:03:56.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and it's just gone into a complete spiral of despair
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.08,0:03:56.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后它因为姐妹不在身边
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.60,0:03:58.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}that its sister wasn't with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.60,0:03:58.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}就陷入了彻底的绝望
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.44,0:03:59.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.44,0:03:59.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}真的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.24,0:04:01.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Pining? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.24,0:04:01.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 思念成疾？ - 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.48,0:04:04.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It actually died of a broken heart?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.48,0:04:04.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以它们真的会心碎而死？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.12,0:04:05.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yes, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.12,0:04:06.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 对 - 天哪 真是…谁能想到呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.12,0:04:06.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Bloody hell. Who knew?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.48,0:04:09.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, look, they're off, they're off.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.48,0:04:09.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}看 它们跑了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.92,0:04:12.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- God... - The women are running away.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.92,0:04:12.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 但母羊们在逃跑 - 天哪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.28,0:04:14.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}They always do, to be fair, at first.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.28,0:04:14.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}说实话 刚开始它们总是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.88,0:04:22.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Leaving the rams to their romancing,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.88,0:04:22.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}把公羊们留在那儿谈情说爱后
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.40,0:04:24.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I headed over to the pub,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.40,0:04:24.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我去了酒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.36,0:04:28.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}because apparently, there'd been a disturbance in the force.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.36,0:04:28.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为显然 那里出大事了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.76,0:04:30.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（农夫的狗）
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.48,0:04:35.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Annie tells me somebody has had an accident in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.48,0:04:32.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（抱歉 已损坏 暂停使用 请使用酒吧洗手间！）
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.32,0:04:35.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}安妮告诉我有人在这儿出了事故
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.68,0:04:56.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.68,0:04:56.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不可能吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.04,0:05:02.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I was so astonished I had to get a second opinion.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.04,0:05:02.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我太震惊了 得再找人确认一下
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.36,0:05:05.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Fuck's sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.36,0:05:05.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.16,0:05:11.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And even a third.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.16,0:05:11.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}甚至还要再确认一次
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.00,0:05:12.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's vile.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.00,0:05:12.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}太恶心了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.16,0:05:14.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's actually vile.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.16,0:05:14.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这实在是太恶心了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.64,0:05:17.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That can't be one person.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.64,0:05:17.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这不可能是一个人拉的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.48,0:05:19.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's gotta be, like, five people.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.48,0:05:19.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这得是五个人差不多
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.00,0:05:24.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This event could not have happened on a worse day.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.00,0:05:22.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这件事
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.44,0:05:25.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}发生得真不是时候
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.80,0:05:30.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Because some very special guests were inbound.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.80,0:05:30.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为有一些 非常特别的客人正在来的路上
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.24,0:05:34.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'd always been keen for the pub to host live music evenings,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.24,0:05:34.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我一直很希望酒吧 能举办现场音乐之夜
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.92,0:05:39.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and Lisa, having trawled through her Irish address book,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.92,0:05:39.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而丽莎翻遍了 她爱尔兰通讯录里的人脉
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.28,0:05:42.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}had managed to book The Corrs.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.28,0:05:41.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}成功约到了可儿家族合唱团
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.24,0:05:42.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（安德丽娅）
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.16,0:05:43.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（莎伦）
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.76,0:05:45.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And a couple of hours later,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.76,0:05:45.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（德丁顿液体废物处理公司）
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.28,0:05:51.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}with the car park hosting a full-on hazmat clean-up operation,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.28,0:05:48.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}几个小时后 当停车场正在上演
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.52,0:05:51.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}一场彻头彻尾的危废清理行动时
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.32,0:05:53.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}they arrived!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.32,0:05:53.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他们到了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.08,0:05:57.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Hello. - Jeremy, I'm Sharon. How are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.08,0:05:57.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你好 - 杰里米 我是莎伦 你好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.08,0:05:58.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Hi there. I'm very well. How are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.08,0:05:58.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}嗨 我很好 你好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.60,0:06:01.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- So here we are. - We're very happy, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.60,0:06:01.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我们到了 - 我们很开心 是的 所以…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.00,0:06:05.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}When was the last time you played at a venue smaller than this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.00,0:06:05.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你们上次在比这还小的场地 演出是什么时候？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.68,0:06:07.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.44,0:06:12.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Once inside, they began the sound check.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.44,0:06:12.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}进屋之后 他们开始试音
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.24,0:06:15.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ So go on, go on ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.24,0:06:15.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}继续
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.88,0:06:18.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ Come on, leave me breathless ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.88,0:06:18.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}来吧 你让我窒息
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.92,0:06:20.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ Tempt me... ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.92,0:06:20.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}诱惑我 挑逗我
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.40,0:06:23.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And as I was taking in this surreal moment,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.40,0:06:23.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}正当我沉浸在这超现实的一刻时
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.88,0:06:26.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}His Cheerfulness arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.88,0:06:26.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“开心果”来了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.56,0:06:29.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Amazing, innit? - It is. But I have been thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.56,0:06:29.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 很棒 对吧？ - 是的 但我一直在想…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.64,0:06:30.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我并不孤单
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.72,0:06:32.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Health and safety... Don't tell me. - No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.72,0:06:32.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 健康和安全…别告诉我 什么？ - 不
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.48,0:06:36.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's gonna be quite difficult to go to the loo while they're singing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.48,0:06:36.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他们唱歌的时候 想去厕所会挺麻烦的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.00,0:06:39.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.00,0:06:38.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我也感觉到了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.60,0:06:39.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.84,0:06:42.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Just... 'Cause they're right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.84,0:06:42.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}就…因为他们就在那儿
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.68,0:06:45.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.68,0:06:45.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我会和你私奔
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.92,0:06:47.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'll cancel it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.92,0:06:47.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那我取消吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.72,0:06:50.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And, you know, power's not perfect here and we have this on?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.72,0:06:50.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而且这里的电力也不是很完美
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.92,0:06:52.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.92,0:06:52.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 还有这个电压… - 不
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.12,0:06:55.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So there's some worry that, you know, we're gonna have to turn stuff off
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.12,0:06:55.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以我有点担心 我们恐怕得关掉一些东西…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.68,0:06:58.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}in there when they start singing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.68,0:06:58.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}比如 他们开始唱的时候 那边得关掉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.32,0:07:01.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The problem is...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.32,0:07:01.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}问题在于…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.16,0:07:02.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, the problem is,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.16,0:07:02.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}问题是已经有很多人订位了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.64,0:07:06.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}we've got people booked in, you know, right the way...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.64,0:07:09.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}8点45分开始就有人了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.64,0:07:09.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}8:45 onwards.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.36,0:07:13.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- So we're still gonna be serving food. - You're saying is we can't serve food
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.36,0:07:10.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以我们还是要供应食物…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.96,0:07:13.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以你的意思是 我们不能同时…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.12,0:07:16.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and have a gig on at the same time?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.12,0:07:16.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 主… - …一边供应食物 一边演出？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.28,0:07:19.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Do you want Andrea Corr to be giving you a bollocking...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.28,0:07:19.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你是想让安德丽娅可儿给你一顿臭骂
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.36,0:07:21.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Or a sausage roll? - Or a sausage roll?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.36,0:07:21.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 还是一根香肠卷？ - …还是一根香肠卷？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.92,0:07:23.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Let's have The Corrs.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.92,0:07:23.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那就保留可儿家族合唱团吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.24,0:07:32.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This seems very exciting.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.24,0:07:32.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这似乎挺刺激的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.56,0:07:34.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Once the sound check was over...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.56,0:07:34.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}试音结束后…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.28,0:07:36.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Those acoustics aren't bad, are they, in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.28,0:07:36.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这里音效不错 是吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.56,0:07:38.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Really good, really good.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.56,0:07:38.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 真的很好 - 非常好
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.04,0:07:40.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I showed The Corrs to their dressing room.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.04,0:07:40.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}…我带可儿家族合唱团 去了他们的化妆间
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.80,0:07:43.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's actually my office, which I've given over to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.80,0:07:43.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这其实是我的办公室 我把它让给你们了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.96,0:07:45.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's very nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.96,0:07:45.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.04,0:07:47.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Oh! Lovely. - Yeah, mind the steps.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.04,0:07:47.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 真贴心 - 嗯 小心台阶
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.88,0:07:49.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This is... Ooh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.88,0:07:49.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这是…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.64,0:07:51.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Wow. - Yeah, it smells a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.64,0:07:51.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这里有点味道
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.56,0:07:52.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Who did the decor?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.56,0:07:52.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}谁做的装修？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.56,0:07:55.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The Smarties are a particularly good touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.56,0:07:57.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 聪明豆是个不错的点缀 - 不 不是聪明豆
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.32,0:07:57.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No, no, no, not Smarties.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.24,0:07:58.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What are they? M&Ms?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.24,0:07:58.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那是什么？是MM豆
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.04,0:08:01.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, but what have we done? Just to show we've...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.04,0:08:01.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 但我们做了什么？ 只是为了表示我们…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.84,0:08:03.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You've taken out the brown ones!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.84,0:08:03.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你把棕色的都挑出来了！ - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.72,0:08:05.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We took out the brown ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.72,0:08:05.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我们把棕色的挑出去了 - 那是王子…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.44,0:08:07.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- That was Prince. - I thought it was Van Halen.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.44,0:08:07.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我还以为是范海伦呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.28,0:08:10.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, it could have been. I thought it was Prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.28,0:08:08.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（禁止入内）
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.20,0:08:10.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 也可能是 我还以为是王子呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.44,0:08:12.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Anyway, this is your green room. - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.44,0:08:12.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 总之 这是你们的休息室 - 不好说
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.16,0:08:14.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}There's my office chair. You're more than welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.16,0:08:14.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这是我的办公椅 随便坐
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.96,0:08:16.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Wow. - Sorry it's not bigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.96,0:08:16.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这里…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.04,0:08:18.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And I'm sorry that there's a beam in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.04,0:08:18.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 很抱歉 这地方不够大 - 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.20,0:08:24.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But well, you're on at 8, and it's now 5.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.20,0:08:20.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}很抱歉这里还有根横梁 但就是…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.52,0:08:22.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你们几点演出？八点
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.56,0:08:24.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}现在五点
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.92,0:08:27.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Anyway, I'll leave you to it. I'm just gonna go out and close the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.92,0:08:27.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}总之 我不打扰你们了 我出去把门关上
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.40,0:08:29.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Could we get a heater? - Don't lock us in now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.40,0:08:29.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你觉得我们能弄个取暖器吗？ - 风扇取暖器？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.12,0:08:30.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}A fan heater? No, we haven't got one.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.12,0:08:30.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 对 就是取暖器 - 不 我们没有
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.76,0:08:32.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Are you sure? - Well, the problem is,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.76,0:08:34.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}问题是我们电力不够
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.64,0:08:34.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}we haven't got enough electricity.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.28,0:08:36.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Oh... - We're genuinely worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.28,0:08:36.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们真的很担心
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.68,0:08:39.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- It's either cooking tonight or singing. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.68,0:08:39.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 今晚要么做饭 要么唱歌 - 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.68,0:08:41.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You won't be disturbed in here, that's the important thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.68,0:08:41.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你们在这里不会被打扰 这才是最重要的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.76,0:08:42.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Okay. - See you later, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.76,0:08:42.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好的 回头见
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.76,0:08:45.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Thanks, Jeremy. - We're a little bit...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.76,0:08:44.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 回头见 各位 - 回头见
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.04,0:08:45.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 谢谢 杰里米 - 祝你们好运
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.52,0:08:54.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}2 hours and 55 minutes later,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.52,0:08:54.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}两小时五十五分钟后
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.36,0:08:56.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The Corrs were, understandably,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.36,0:08:56.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}可儿家族合唱团迫不及待地想上台了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.80,0:08:58.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}quite keen to get on stage.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.80,0:08:58.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这也可以理解
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.72,0:09:00.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.72,0:08:59.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（农民俱乐部）
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.64,0:09:00.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}天哪
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.56,0:09:05.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I do love you touring with James May, I think that's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.56,0:09:05.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我真的很喜欢你和詹姆斯梅一起巡演 我觉得很棒
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.92,0:09:08.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's nice to see he's got gainful employment.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.92,0:09:08.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}很高兴看到他有了正经工作
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.48,0:09:11.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Ladies and gentlemen!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.48,0:09:11.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}女士们 先生们
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.28,0:09:15.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.28,0:09:15.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}非常感谢大家
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.72,0:09:20.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Next week, they will be performing at the O2,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.72,0:09:20.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}下周 他们将在O2体育馆演出
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.24,0:09:21.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}but tonight,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.24,0:09:21.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但今晚
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.88,0:09:24.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}they will be performing in The Farmer's Dog,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.88,0:09:24.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他们将在农夫的狗演出
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.44,0:09:26.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}the first band to do so.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.44,0:09:26.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这是在这里演出的第一支乐队
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.24,0:09:29.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Ladies and gentlemen, The Corrs!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.24,0:09:29.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}女士们 先生们 有请可儿家族合唱团！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.96,0:09:37.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Good evening, you fine folk of The Farmer's Dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.96,0:09:37.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}晚上好 农夫的狗的各位朋友们
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.60,0:09:53.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The Corrs then delighted the room with some of their biggest hits.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.60,0:09:52.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}随后 可儿家族合唱团
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.00,0:09:53.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}为全场献上了他们的一些金曲
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.88,0:09:57.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ So go on, go on ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.88,0:09:57.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}继续
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.52,0:10:00.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ Come on, leave me breathless ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.52,0:10:00.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}来吧 你让我窒息
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.48,0:10:03.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ Tempt me, tease me ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.48,0:10:03.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}诱惑我 挑逗我
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.12,0:10:05.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ Until I can't deny this ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.12,0:10:05.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}直到我无法否认
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.64,0:10:11.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ I would run away with you ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.64,0:10:11.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我会和你私奔
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.96,0:10:13.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ Because... ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.96,0:10:13.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.40,0:10:19.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ I have fallen in love ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.40,0:10:16.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我已经
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.76,0:10:21.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}爱上了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.44,0:10:23.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ With you ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.44,0:10:23.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.48,0:10:26.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Do you remember The Corrs?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.48,0:10:26.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你记得可儿家族合唱团吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.28,0:10:27.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.28,0:10:27.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不记得
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.64,0:10:29.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No idea who they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.64,0:10:29.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}完全不知道他们是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.60,0:10:41.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}By the end, Charlie had stopped worrying about electricity and lavatories
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.60,0:10:39.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}演出结束时 查理已经不再担心
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.36,0:10:41.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}电力和厕所的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.48,0:10:44.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and had even taken to the dancefloor.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.48,0:10:44.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}甚至去了舞池跳舞
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.52,0:11:02.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Thank you very much!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.52,0:11:02.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}非常感谢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.28,0:11:06.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.28,0:11:06.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}非常感谢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.12,0:11:12.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Afterwards, their biggest fan of many years standing couldn't wait
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.12,0:11:09.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 干得好 好 - 唱得不错
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.00,0:11:12.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}之后 他们多年的“铁粉”
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.52,0:11:14.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}to congratulate them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.52,0:11:14.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}迫不及待地向他们表示祝贺
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.44,0:11:17.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Lovely to meet you. That was amazing. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.44,0:11:15.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你们太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.52,0:11:17.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 很高兴见到你们 太棒了 - 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.00,0:11:19.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That vibe, honestly...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.00,0:11:19.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那种氛围 说实话 我当时…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.20,0:11:23.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}For me, tonight is the full pinch-pinch.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.20,0:11:23.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对我来说 今晚真是 完美得不能再完美了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.40,0:11:27.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}When you go, "We had this idea of what the pub would be like",
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.40,0:11:25.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 对 - 当你去…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.20,0:11:27.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们曾经对这家酒吧有过各种设想
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.80,0:11:29.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and then you look at this and go,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.80,0:11:29.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后看到这一切 你就会想
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.60,0:11:32.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}"We've done it, we've actually done it."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.60,0:11:32.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-“我们做到了 我们真的做到了” - 是的 完美
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.00,0:11:35.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（农夫的狗）
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.56,0:11:44.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}A couple of days later, it was time for another big event,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.56,0:11:44.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}几天后 又一个重要活动要开始了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.16,0:11:48.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}only this one was much more serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.16,0:11:48.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}只不过这一个要严肃得多
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.24,0:11:51.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Here we are, look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.24,0:11:51.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们到了 看看这个
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.00,0:11:57.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Because today was the day of the farmers' rally in London.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.00,0:11:57.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为今天是农民在伦敦集会的日子
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.84,0:12:10.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Morning, all. - Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.84,0:12:10.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 大家早上好 - 早上好
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.92,0:12:12.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.92,0:12:12.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.20,0:12:13.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Hello. - Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.20,0:12:13.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你好 - 你好
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.48,0:12:14.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}James.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.48,0:12:14.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 詹姆斯 - 詹姆斯 嗨 查理
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.44,0:12:17.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}James, hi. Charlie. Pleased to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.44,0:12:17.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}很高兴见到你
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.16,0:12:24.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The Diddly Squat convoy thundered down the M40.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.16,0:12:24.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}迪丽斯库阿特车队 在M40高速上一路轰鸣南下
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.20,0:12:27.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And once it reached London,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.20,0:12:27.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}等车队到达伦敦后
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.64,0:12:33.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I sought advice on the conundrum running round my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.64,0:12:28.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（支持英国农业）
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.84,0:12:33.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我找人请教了那个让我纠结的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.92,0:12:37.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Right, to speak or not to speak? Shall we have a vote?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.92,0:12:37.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好了 发言还是不发言 我们投票表决一下？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.84,0:12:41.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What, just generally speak or not to speak?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.84,0:12:41.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}什么？就普通发言还是不发言？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.24,0:12:44.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, the doctor told me not to speak. Amazon's told me not to speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.24,0:12:44.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}医生让我不要发言 亚马逊也让我不要发言
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.84,0:12:55.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- There it is, Kaleb, look. - What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.84,0:12:55.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 卡莱布 你看那儿 - 那是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.40,0:12:57.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- That's the Royal Albert Hall. - Is that a museum?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.40,0:12:57.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那是皇家阿尔伯特音乐厅
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.20,0:12:59.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.20,0:12:58.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那是博物馆吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.84,0:12:59.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不是
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.08,0:13:05.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}At the end is Parliament Square, where the Houses of Parliament are.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.08,0:13:04.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这条街的尽头就是议会广场
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.32,0:13:05.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}议会大厦就在那儿
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.32,0:13:09.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Right, let's get kitted up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.32,0:13:09.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好了 我们备好装备
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.44,0:13:12.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Morning, morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.44,0:13:12.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}早上好
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.68,0:13:15.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Are you all completely lost now, I'm guessing, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.68,0:13:15.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我猜你们现在 都完全迷路了吧 对不对？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.72,0:13:16.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Yeah. - I've lived here 30 years. Follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.72,0:13:16.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 是的 - 没事
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.88,0:13:19.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I know where we're going.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.88,0:13:19.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我在这儿住了三十年 跟我走 我知道怎么走
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.60,0:13:25.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}None of us fancied being part of a riot-hungry mob,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.60,0:13:25.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们谁也不想成为 那帮渴望暴乱的暴徒中的一员
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.64,0:13:28.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}but when we reached Whitehall, the location of the rally,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.64,0:13:28.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但当我们到达集会地点白厅时
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.84,0:13:30.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}veteran broadcaster Andrew Marr
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.84,0:13:30.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}资深播音员安德鲁马尔
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.52,0:13:34.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}sort of put that worry to bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.52,0:13:31.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（拯救英国农业）
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.92,0:13:34.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}差不多打消了这个顾虑
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.64,0:13:38.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's early in the day, it's only 11 o'clock or so, and it's wet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.64,0:13:38.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}今天还早 才十一点左右 而且下着雨
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.20,0:13:41.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Lots of comments about this is gonna be overtaken by the Far Right,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.20,0:13:41.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}很多人评论说 这次集会将被极右翼势力控制
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.52,0:13:42.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}it was going to be extremist.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.52,0:13:42.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}说它会变得极端
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.84,0:13:44.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And I've come down to look.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.84,0:13:44.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我过来看了看
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.60,0:13:47.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And this is mainstream, patient, weather-beaten,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.60,0:13:47.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这走上街头的都是主流、有耐心
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.68,0:13:50.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}decent Britain on the streets. It's really impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.68,0:13:48.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（与农民 一起）
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.60,0:13:50.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}饱经风霜、正派的英国人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.00,0:13:51.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}真的很了不起
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.24,0:13:53.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（人民）
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.20,0:13:54.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Isle of Wight.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.20,0:13:55.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 怀特岛 - 赫特福德郡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.24,0:13:55.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Hertfordshire. - Devon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.84,0:13:56.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}德文郡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.36,0:14:02.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We're quite a small farm, only about just over 200 acres,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.36,0:14:02.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们的农场很小 只有两百多英亩
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.60,0:14:05.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}but it's gonna hit us hard. We're arable.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.60,0:14:05.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但这对我们的打击会很大 我们是种植庄稼的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.20,0:14:08.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We'll never ever be able to afford what they want us to pay
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.20,0:14:08.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们永远、永远都付不起 他们想要我们付的钱
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.88,0:14:10.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and we will have to sell up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.88,0:14:10.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们将不得不卖掉农场
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.88,0:14:14.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}How can you ask people to give up a lifestyle
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.88,0:14:14.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你怎么能要求人们放弃一种生活方式
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.84,0:14:17.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and punish them for producing food
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.84,0:14:17.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}并因为他们生产粮食
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.24,0:14:19.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and looking after the countryside?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.24,0:14:19.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}照看乡村而惩罚他们呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.44,0:14:20.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（没农民没粮食没未来）
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.48,0:14:25.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Meanwhile, Charlie had been asked by a reporter for a quick comment.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.48,0:14:22.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（拯救我们的家庭农场 不要让农民离开土地）
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.36,0:14:25.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}与此同时 一位记者请查理简单说两句
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.16,0:14:29.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And she was indeed getting his version of "quick".
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.16,0:14:29.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而她确实正在领教他所谓的“简单”
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.44,0:14:32.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Out of those 1,500, there will be a minority that are not impacted
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.44,0:14:32.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}在那1500个农场里 会有一小部分
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.88,0:14:36.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}by the combination of business and Agricultural Property Relief.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.88,0:14:34.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不受商业和农业财产
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.84,0:14:36.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}减免政策合并的影响
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.52,0:14:38.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You know, it has a massive impact.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.52,0:14:38.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这影响巨大 不仅仅是经济上
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.92,0:14:41.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yes, financially, but also on confidence
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.92,0:14:43.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}还有对未来生产进行投资的信心
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.80,0:14:43.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}to invest in future production...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.92,0:14:46.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而那种信心已经被抽走了…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.80,0:14:49.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（几分钟后…）
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.76,0:14:53.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's 1.2 million.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.76,0:14:53.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}…比如 一头奶牛值2000英镑 那总共就是120万
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.52,0:14:56.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So they'll have a tax liability on the actual asset
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.52,0:14:56.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以 他们将要为实际生产的资产
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.84,0:14:58.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}that they're producing milk from.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.84,0:14:58.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 缴纳一项税款 - 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.44,0:15:01.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We're 2 minutes over time, if that's okay to wrap, that'd be great.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.44,0:15:01.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们现在超时两分钟了 如果您能总结陈词
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.72,0:15:03.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.72,0:15:03.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 那就太好了 谢谢 - 非常感谢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.72,0:15:07.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}By noon, with Whitehall absolutely packed
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.72,0:15:07.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}到了中午 白厅被成千上万的农民
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.52,0:15:11.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}by thousands of farmers and their families,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.52,0:15:11.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}和他们的家人挤得水泄不通
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.12,0:15:12.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}the speakers took to the stage.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.12,0:15:12.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}演讲者们登上了舞台
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.32,0:15:14.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This week in the Lords, I spoke against this proposal
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.32,0:15:14.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（抗击税收 拯救我们的农场 乡村联盟）
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.04,0:15:18.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}from the Labour benches.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.04,0:15:17.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}本周在上议院 我反对了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.24,0:15:18.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}工党提出的这项建议
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.40,0:15:19.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And from every bench in that house,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.40,0:15:19.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（马勒利 工党贵族院议员）
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.48,0:15:21.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Conservative, Liberal Democrat, cross-benchers, and even the bishops,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.48,0:15:21.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}来自议院内每一个席位的发言者
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.48,0:15:28.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}speakers condemned this policy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.48,0:15:26.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}保守党、自由民主党 中立议员 甚至主教们
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.56,0:15:29.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}都谴责了这项政策
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.24,0:15:32.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You have...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.24,0:15:32.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你们…你们得到了…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.24,0:15:37.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You have the backing of the nation for what you are doing here today.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.24,0:15:35.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你们今天的行动得到了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.04,0:15:37.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}全国人民的支持
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.36,0:15:40.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.36,0:15:40.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}非常好
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.64,0:15:41.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm Olly Harrison.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.64,0:15:41.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（只想养活你们）
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.56,0:15:44.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm just an arable farmer from near Liverpool.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.56,0:15:44.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我是奥利哈里森 我只是个 来自利物浦附近 种植庄稼的农民
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.92,0:15:50.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}My family has farmed in Tarbock for 175 years,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.92,0:15:50.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我的家族在塔博克 已经耕作了175年
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.32,0:15:52.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}with me being the fifth generation,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.32,0:15:52.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我是第五代
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.96,0:15:55.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and James' dreaming of being the sixth.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.96,0:15:55.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而詹姆斯梦想着成为第六代
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.52,0:16:00.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（你不能吃税收）
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.24,0:16:02.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Why do we farm?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.24,0:16:02.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们为什么耕作？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.24,0:16:06.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Why do we accept low prices?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.24,0:16:06.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们为什么接受低廉的价格？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.92,0:16:10.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Why do we put up with low wages and long hours?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.92,0:16:10.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们为什么忍受 低工资和长时间的工作？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.56,0:16:13.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'll tell you why.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.56,0:16:13.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我来告诉你们为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.08,0:16:16.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We farm for our children.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.08,0:16:16.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们为我们的孩子而耕作
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.68,0:16:20.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We farm to feed the nation.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.68,0:16:20.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们为养活这个国家而耕作
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.36,0:16:24.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We farm because it's in our blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.36,0:16:22.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（没农民 没食物）
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.48,0:16:24.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们耕作 因为 这是我们骨子里的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.04,0:16:28.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And we farm because we love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.04,0:16:28.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们耕作 因为我们热爱
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.96,0:16:32.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No one does it for the money.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.96,0:16:32.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}没有谁是为了钱才做这事的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.56,0:16:34.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}There is none.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.56,0:16:34.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为根本不赚钱
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.68,0:16:39.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Do they know what it's like to get up at 4 a.m. to feed cows?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.68,0:16:39.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他们知道凌晨四点 起来喂牛是什么感觉吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.84,0:16:42.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.84,0:16:42.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 不知道！ - 不知道！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.72,0:16:46.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Do they know what it's like to give CPR to a weak lamb?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.72,0:16:46.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他们知道给一只虚弱的小羊羔 做心肺复苏是什么感觉吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.08,0:16:47.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.08,0:16:47.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不知道！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.04,0:16:52.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Do they know what it's like to unblock a combine at 2 a.m.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.04,0:16:52.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他们知道凌晨两点 徒手清理联合收割机堵塞
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.40,0:16:55.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}with bleeding hands and knuckles 'cause of the thistle in it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.40,0:16:55.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}被蓟刺扎得满手流血 是什么感觉吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.24,0:16:57.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.24,0:16:57.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不知道！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.76,0:17:00.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Do the government even know where food comes from?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.76,0:17:00.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}政府到底知不知道食物从哪里来的？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.20,0:17:02.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.20,0:17:02.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不知道！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.80,0:17:06.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Today we come together to show the government we will be heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.80,0:17:06.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}今天我们聚在一起 就是要让政府听到我们的声音
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.80,0:17:07.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Downing Street, if you can hear us,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.80,0:17:07.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（抗击税收）
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.84,0:17:12.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}you need to fix this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.84,0:17:11.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}唐宁街 如果你们能听到
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.00,0:17:12.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你们必须解决这个问题
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.64,0:17:15.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.84,0:17:18.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（农民要求大反转！）
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.36,0:17:24.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I couldn't possibly match the emotional power of Olly's words,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.36,0:17:24.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我可能比不上奥利 那番话的情感冲击力
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.80,0:17:28.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}but I did think there was one point I could make.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.80,0:17:28.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但我确实觉得有一点是我能说的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.40,0:17:31.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Hello everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.40,0:17:31.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}大家好！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.72,0:17:36.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Now, I know a lot of people, all across the country, in all walks of life,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.72,0:17:36.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我知道全国上下、各行各业的很多人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.72,0:17:39.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}took a bit of a kick on the shin with that budget.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.72,0:17:39.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}都在这次预算案中受到了打击
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.04,0:17:42.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You lot got a knee in the nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.04,0:17:40.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（不要恩将仇报）
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.24,0:17:42.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而你们挨了一记狠的！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.68,0:17:45.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.68,0:17:45.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我知道你们今天已经听了很多了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.72,0:17:48.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You've heard a lot about it today and I'm not gonna dwell on that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.72,0:17:48.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我就不再多说了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.88,0:17:51.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I will just say this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.88,0:17:52.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我只说一句 蕾切尔里夫斯告诉我们
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.12,0:17:52.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Rachel Reeves has told us...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.68,0:17:54.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.68,0:17:59.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}百分之七十二的农场 不会受到这项政策的影响
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.68,0:17:59.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}72% of farms are gonna be unaffected by this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.60,0:18:01.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Let's see if we can educate her here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.60,0:18:01.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们来试试看能不能给她上一课
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.00,0:18:04.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}How many people here, if you'd raise your hands, are from a family farm?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.00,0:18:04.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}现场有多少人来自家庭农场？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.64,0:18:09.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I want to see. Right, that's a lot of hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.64,0:18:06.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}请举手
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.76,0:18:09.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我想看看…好的 很多手
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.72,0:18:13.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Now, I want you to lower them if, if...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.72,0:18:13.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}现在 如果你们经过思考
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.28,0:18:15.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}you think, and you've had time to work this out,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.28,0:18:15.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}算清楚了 认为你们不会
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.88,0:18:18.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}you think you're going to be unaffected
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.88,0:18:21.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}受到APR和BPR政策变化的影响 请把手放下
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.56,0:18:20.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}by the changes to APR and BPR.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.08,0:18:23.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Put your hands down if you're gonna be unaffected.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.08,0:18:23.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}认为自己不受影响的 请把手放下
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.32,0:18:25.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.32,0:18:27.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}谢谢 我的陈述完毕
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.68,0:18:27.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}My case rests.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.44,0:18:31.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Thank you, everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.44,0:18:31.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}谢谢大家！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.48,0:18:35.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（热爱英国农业）
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.36,0:18:45.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}In the end, I was glad I'd gone to the rally and spoken,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.36,0:18:45.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}最后 我很庆幸 自己去了集会并发了言
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.24,0:18:48.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}but not everyone shared that view.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.24,0:18:48.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但并不是所有人都这么看
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.56,0:18:54.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Doctor went berserk with me last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.56,0:18:54.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}医生昨晚对我大发雷霆
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.28,0:18:55.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What for? Just...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.28,0:18:55.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}为什么？就因为…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.60,0:18:57.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}She went,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.60,0:18:57.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}她说
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.88,0:19:01.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}"You know we told you to have six weeks rest?"
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.88,0:19:01.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“你知道我们让你休息六周”
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.40,0:19:04.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}She said, "I meant sitting by the fire drinking minestrone soup..."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.40,0:19:04.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}她说：“我的意思是 让你坐在火边喝点蔬菜汤…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.16,0:19:07.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}"Reading a book."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.16,0:19:07.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}看看书”
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.52,0:19:11.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I haven't been doing that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.52,0:19:11.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我没做到
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.80,0:19:15.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What can I do, K?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.80,0:19:15.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我还能做什么 老卡？ - 上去！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.56,0:19:18.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Kaleb and Lisa obviously agreed with the doctor,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.56,0:19:18.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}卡莱布和丽莎显然同意医生的看法
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.20,0:19:21.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}because when I tried to help them with the cow weighing,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.20,0:19:19.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}快走！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.12,0:19:22.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为当我试图帮他们给牛称重时
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.04,0:19:24.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I was immediately fired.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.04,0:19:24.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我立刻就被解雇了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.00,0:19:27.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No, no, no, don't. Stop it! Just don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.00,0:19:27.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不 别动 停下！别动
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.20,0:19:32.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You're gonna hurt your back and then you're gonna go...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.20,0:19:30.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 好的 - 你会伤到自己的背
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.84,0:19:32.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 然后你就会… - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.48,0:19:35.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I love this! This is great!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.48,0:19:35.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我喜欢这样 这太棒了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.28,0:19:38.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I know you don't want me helping but who would do this without me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.28,0:19:38.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我知道你们不想让我帮忙 但没有我 这事儿谁干得了？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.44,0:19:40.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, I think Kaleb and I could manage it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.44,0:19:40.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我觉得我和卡莱布就能搞定
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.16,0:19:42.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.16,0:19:42.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}走！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.56,0:19:44.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}592.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.56,0:19:44.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}五九二
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.48,0:19:48.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Having been shooed away, I did some irritating government paperwork.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.48,0:19:48.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}被赶走后 我去处理了 一些令人头疼的政府文书工作
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.16,0:19:53.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But this quickly became boring.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.16,0:19:53.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但这很快就变得无聊了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.68,0:19:57.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So I went down to the woods to cut down a Christmas tree for the pub.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.68,0:19:57.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}于是 我跑到林子里 去为酒吧砍圣诞树
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.08,0:20:00.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Where are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.08,0:20:00.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}在哪儿呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.72,0:20:02.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yes... There's a tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.72,0:20:02.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}有了 就是这棵树
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.60,0:20:05.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's a beauty.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.60,0:20:05.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}真漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.96,0:20:07.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I must be careful...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.96,0:20:07.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我得小心
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.08,0:20:11.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}not to cut myself, 'cause I'm on blood thinners.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.08,0:20:11.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}别割伤自己 因为我在吃抗凝药
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.88,0:20:14.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}As it turned out,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.88,0:20:16.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}事实证明 这还不是 真正要紧的医疗问题
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.52,0:20:17.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}this wasn't the medical issue that mattered.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.88,0:20:42.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I shouldn't have done that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.88,0:20:42.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我不该做这事
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.24,0:20:57.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Not doing that again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.24,0:20:57.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我再也不砍树了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.12,0:21:01.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}After this, I decided I needed a proper rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.12,0:21:01.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这之后 我决定我需要好好休息一下
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.32,0:21:09.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But that night, Mother Nature decided otherwise.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.32,0:21:09.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但那天晚上 大自然母亲却另有安排
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.28,0:21:13.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Storm Darragh has left thousands of people without power
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.28,0:21:13.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}风暴“达拉格”已导致英国
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.00,0:21:15.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}across the UK and the Republic of Ireland.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.00,0:21:15.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}和爱尔兰共和国数千人断电
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.36,0:21:18.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}A rare "red" warning for strong winds has been issued,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.36,0:21:18.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}罕见发布了强风红色预警
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.36,0:21:20.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}meaning there's a danger to life.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.36,0:21:20.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这意味着有生命危险
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.88,0:21:23.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（农夫的狗 酒吧与餐厅）
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.48,0:21:31.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（丽莎拍摄）
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.96,0:21:34.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The sound is terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.96,0:21:34.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这声音太可怕了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.96,0:21:47.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}My big worry is the trees.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.96,0:21:47.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我最担心的是这些树
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.72,0:21:54.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Ah, Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.72,0:21:54.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}天哪
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.72,0:22:10.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（农夫的狗）
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.28,0:22:13.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}In the morning, I met with Annie for a damage report.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.28,0:22:13.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}早上 我去找安妮了解损失情况
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.12,0:22:21.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It swung twice, it went really high, 90 degrees, cracked,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.12,0:22:21.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它晃了两下 摆得非常高 九十度
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.92,0:22:25.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and straight down, missed the bonnet of a car by centimetres.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.92,0:22:23.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后裂开 直直地砸了下来
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.60,0:22:25.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}差几厘米就砸到一辆车的引擎盖了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.80,0:22:27.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, that would be... That's a weighty item, innit?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.80,0:22:27.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 砰 - 嗯 那会…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.12,0:22:29.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You can't move it. It's too heavy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.12,0:22:29.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 那东西很重 对吧？ - 你搬不动它 太重了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.88,0:22:32.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Oh, God, yeah. - I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.88,0:22:32.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 天哪 是啊 - 我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.44,0:22:36.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Shit, look at it. - Yeah, it is ripped.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.44,0:22:34.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}该死 你看
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.80,0:22:36.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是啊 确实裂开了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.44,0:22:38.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Morning. - Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.44,0:22:38.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 早上好！ - 早上好！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.04,0:22:44.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So there's a beam come down there, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.04,0:22:44.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你看 那边有一根横梁掉下来了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.68,0:22:47.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And 'cause we've lost the structure of the outside,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.68,0:22:47.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而且因为外面的结构已经坏了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.56,0:22:48.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}these could now come down.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.56,0:22:49.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 这些也可能会掉下来 - 该死
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.72,0:22:49.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Shit...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.64,0:22:55.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Outside, there was more carnage in the car park.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.64,0:22:55.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}外面 停车场里更是一片狼藉
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.52,0:22:59.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}All of the festoon lighting has been ripped.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.52,0:22:59.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所有的彩灯都被扯断了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.24,0:23:03.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And some of the trees had indeed taken a battering.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.24,0:23:03.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而且有些树确实遭到了重创
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.48,0:23:05.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The one that's most precarious is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.48,0:23:05.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}最危险的那棵是…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.52,0:23:07.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Oh, yeah, shit. - That's not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.52,0:23:07.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 嗯 操 - 那可不妙
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.68,0:23:11.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.68,0:23:11.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.28,0:23:19.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Back at the farm, Lisa was surveying what 10 hours ago had been
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.28,0:23:19.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}回到农场 丽莎正在查看十小时前
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.44,0:23:22.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}the house where her faceless sheep lived.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.44,0:23:22.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}还是她的那些无脸羊住的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.36,0:23:32.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Jesus Christ. - I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.36,0:23:32.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 天哪！ - 我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.44,0:23:35.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah. Luckily the sheep weren't in it when it tumbled.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.44,0:23:35.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 幸运的是 树倒的时候羊没在里面
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.40,0:23:38.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We built a little pen for them out of straw
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.40,0:23:38.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以我们用稻草给它们搭了个小围栏
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.88,0:23:41.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}but I've got to get them into the barn,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.88,0:23:41.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但我得把它们弄进谷仓
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.04,0:23:42.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}the cow barn on the other side.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.04,0:23:42.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 另一边的牛棚 - 不 我们可以把它们放进新谷仓
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.52,0:23:44.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- We'll put them in the new barn. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.52,0:23:45.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 不 牛棚更好 - 不 新谷仓
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.40,0:23:45.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- The cow barn's better. - No, the new barn.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.68,0:23:48.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- We can't put them in the new barn. - Why can't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.68,0:23:48.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我们不能把它们放进新谷仓 - 为什么不能放进新谷仓？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.20,0:23:51.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Because I've got... some snails in there that I'm breeding.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.20,0:23:51.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为我在里面养了一些蜗牛
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.68,0:23:52.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- I mean... - Snails?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.68,0:23:52.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我要…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.64,0:23:53.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.64,0:23:53.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 蜗牛？ - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.20,0:23:58.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Every time we have a barn that's empty for 5 minutes, you fill it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.20,0:23:58.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}每次我们有个谷仓空出来五分钟 你就会把它填满
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.36,0:24:00.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It was totally empty for about a month.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.36,0:24:00.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这个谷仓空了差不多一个月呢
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.04,0:24:02.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.04,0:24:02.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你看
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.28,0:24:03.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh my f-! What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.28,0:24:03.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我靠…什么鬼？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.84,0:24:06.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Nice, right. - What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.84,0:24:06.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 不错吧？ - 这是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.16,0:24:07.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Tada! Behold.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.16,0:24:07.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}注意！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.36,0:24:12.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So I've got a thousand snails. They're gonna breed.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.36,0:24:12.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以我养了一千只蜗牛 它们会繁殖
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.08,0:24:13.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- But why have you got them? - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.08,0:24:13.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}可你为什么要养它们？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.76,0:24:16.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- So when the mucin starts coming out... - The what?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.76,0:24:16.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好吧 当粘蛋白开始分泌的时候…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.32,0:24:18.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The mucin. The slime that comes out. It's called mucin.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.32,0:24:18.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 什么？ - 粘蛋白
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.08,0:24:20.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And it's anti-inflammatory. It's anti-ageing.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.08,0:24:20.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}就是它们分泌的那种黏液 学名叫粘蛋白
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.24,0:24:25.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So, so... We're gonna have to start from the beginning. I'm utterly lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.24,0:24:22.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它有抗炎、抗衰老的功效…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.60,0:24:24.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以…就…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.00,0:24:25.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们得从头说起
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.64,0:24:27.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.64,0:24:27.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我完全听糊涂了 - 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.28,0:24:29.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Snail slime. - Yes, it's a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.28,0:24:29.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 蜗牛黏液… - 对 是种好东西
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.08,0:24:31.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- It's what you're farming here. - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.08,0:24:31.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- …就是你在养的东西 - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.56,0:24:32.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- A lot of beef farmers... - The slime?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.56,0:24:32.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 很多养蜂人… - 养黏液？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.88,0:24:34.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Yes! And the slime... - What do you do with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.88,0:24:34.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对！而且这种黏液…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.52,0:24:35.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, I put it on my face and it's amazing on the hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.52,0:24:35.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后你拿它做什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.84,0:24:38.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's really good. And it's hypoallergenic.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.84,0:24:38.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我把它涂在脸上 它对手的效果也特别好
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.48,0:24:41.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You can't get an allergy from it because it's totally pure.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.48,0:24:41.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它真的很棒 而且它不会… 它不容易过敏
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.08,0:24:43.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Vegans can have it 'cause no animals have been killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.08,0:24:43.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你不会对它过敏 因为它非常纯净
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.60,0:24:46.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And it's anti-inflammatory as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.60,0:24:46.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}纯素食者也可以用 因为没有动物被宰杀
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.16,0:24:50.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So if you've kinda got joint stiffness, it's incredible, it's so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.16,0:24:47.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而且它还有抗炎作用
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.80,0:24:50.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以如果你关节僵硬的话 它效果特别好
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.72,0:24:54.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So, hang on. They go along and they leave slime, we know this.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.72,0:24:52.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 太好了！ - 那等等
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.20,0:24:54.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它们爬过的时候会留下黏液 这个我们都知道
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.48,0:24:55.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.48,0:24:55.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.72,0:24:57.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And then, let me just see if I've got this clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.72,0:24:57.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后 我确认一下我有没有理解对
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.88,0:25:02.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You take it to the farm shop and you sell snail slime.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.88,0:24:58.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.80,0:25:02.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你把它拿去农场商店卖… 就是蜗牛黏液
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.96,0:25:06.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No, no, I make it into a cream by using the slime.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.96,0:25:05.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不是 我用黏液
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.28,0:25:06.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 做成面霜 - 怎么…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.68,0:25:08.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- So how many have you bought? - Only a thousand.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.68,0:25:08.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那你买了多少只？大概…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.72,0:25:10.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}There's a thousand?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.72,0:25:10.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 也就一千只 - 有一千只？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.80,0:25:12.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We'll have 80.000 thousand once they mate.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.80,0:25:12.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}等它们交配了 我们就会有八万只
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.76,0:25:15.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- What? - Good, right? Prolific.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.76,0:25:15.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 什么？ - 不错吧？繁殖力超强
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.80,0:25:23.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And the snails weren't the only livestock that Lisa had on the go.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.80,0:25:23.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而且 蜗牛还不是 丽莎养的唯一一种家畜
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.76,0:25:27.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（十一月 - 十月 - 九月 八月 - 七月）
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.60,0:25:31.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Back in the summer, she'd taken delivery of a flock of geese.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.60,0:25:31.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}夏天的时候 她还收到了一批鹅
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.84,0:25:34.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Right, girls... and boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.84,0:25:34.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好了 姑娘们 还有小伙子们
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.00,0:25:35.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Geeses.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.00,0:25:35.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}鹅们…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.88,0:25:39.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Which had thrilled the Diddly Squat goose expert, Gerald.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.88,0:25:39.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这让迪丽斯库阿特的 养鹅专家杰拉德兴奋不已
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.96,0:25:44.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Bzz, on the top of that, yeah? - Oh yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.96,0:25:43.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那只大的 就是头冠上 有个东西的那只大的？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.36,0:25:44.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}嗯 对？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.32,0:25:48.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Over the following months, she'd worked tirelessly...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.32,0:25:48.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}在接下来的几个月里 她不知疲倦地工作
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.24,0:25:52.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}In all weathers...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.24,0:25:52.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}无论什么天气
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.60,0:25:55.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, fuck a duck.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.60,0:25:55.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}真让人崩溃
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.08,0:25:56.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And round the clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.08,0:25:56.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}夜以继日
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.48,0:25:57.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}See you in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.48,0:25:57.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}早上见
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.76,0:26:01.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}To rear and fatten them.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.76,0:26:01.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}把它们养大育肥
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.80,0:26:03.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Morning, morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.80,0:26:03.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}早上好 早上好！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.00,0:26:04.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Morning, morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.08,0:26:08.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Ugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.16,0:26:16.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}One, two, three, four, five...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.16,0:26:16.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}一、二、三、四、五
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.20,0:26:18.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And now, on a cold December evening,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.20,0:26:18.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}现在 在一个寒冷的十二月夜晚
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.60,0:26:20.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}all that hard work was set to pay off
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.60,0:26:20.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}当她准备开始举办…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.92,0:26:22.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}as she prepared to put on the first
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.92,0:26:22.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（丽莎的鹅 迪丽斯库阿特烤鹅）
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.24,0:26:26.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}in a series of festive geese nights.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.24,0:26:26.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}第一期节日烤鹅之夜时 所有辛勤工作都将得到了回报
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.88,0:26:29.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So this is what... You should be proud, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.88,0:26:29.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以这些…这就是… 你真的应该感到骄傲
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.16,0:26:30.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- I am. They look beautiful. - You should be.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.16,0:26:30.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}确实！它们看起来真棒
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.68,0:26:34.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I thought it might be weird looking at them, but they do look perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.68,0:26:32.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我还以为看着它们会觉得奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.60,0:26:34.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但它们看起来确实很完美
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.44,0:26:38.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And look, they've been well stuffed and there's no little hairs and stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.44,0:26:38.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而且你看 它们填充得很好 也没有什么小细毛之类的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.36,0:26:40.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}They look great. Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.36,0:26:40.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它们看起来棒极了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.48,0:26:45.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I hope tonight works well, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.48,0:26:45.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}其实 我希望今晚能顺利进行
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.40,0:26:50.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm gonna leave it to Lisa. It's Lisa's Geeses night.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.40,0:26:48.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我不会…我会把这件事交给丽莎
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.20,0:26:50.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这是“丽莎的烤鹅之夜”
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.84,0:26:54.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And anyway, I had some festive plans of my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.84,0:26:54.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而且不管怎样 我自己也有一些节日计划
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.20,0:26:58.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So I asked Charlie to join me in my office for a briefing.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.20,0:26:58.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}于是我请查理 到我的办公室来开个简报会
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.72,0:27:00.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We need a grotto.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.72,0:27:00.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们需要一个小屋
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.04,0:27:03.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- What? - Well, we need a Christmas grotto.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.04,0:27:03.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 什么？ - 我们需要一个圣诞老人小屋
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.28,0:27:06.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- I've had a brainwave. Don't worry. - You mean, as in...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.28,0:27:06.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我灵机一动 别担心
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.88,0:27:11.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Elves and Santa and... - Yes, exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.88,0:27:08.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你是说 那种有…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.60,0:27:10.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你知道… - 有小精灵和圣诞老人…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.48,0:27:12.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 没错
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.36,0:27:14.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Because we don't need the goose hut at the moment,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.36,0:27:14.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为我们目前不需要那个鹅棚
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.88,0:27:17.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}because the geeses aren't in it 'cause they're all...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.88,0:27:17.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为鹅不在里面 它们都…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.16,0:27:21.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- So we'll bring the goose hut over here. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.16,0:27:21.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以 我们把那个鹅棚搬过来
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.52,0:27:25.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And we'll use that as the grotto.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.52,0:27:22.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好的
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.72,0:27:24.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后我们就把它当作圣诞老人小屋
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.88,0:27:27.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So I'll put Father Christmas in it,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.88,0:27:27.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}把圣诞老人放进去
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.76,0:27:30.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}children come, Father Christmas gives them a little present,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.76,0:27:30.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}孩子们过来 圣诞老人给他们一个小礼物
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.00,0:27:33.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}you know, some little toy,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.00,0:27:33.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你知道的 一些小玩具
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.08,0:27:35.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and we'll have a Nativity scene outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.08,0:27:35.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后我们在外面 摆一个耶稣诞生的场景
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.76,0:27:40.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Where are we gonna find a Santa? It's December.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.76,0:27:40.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们去哪儿找圣诞老人？ 现在是十二月了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.32,0:27:45.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We need to check them, background checks.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.32,0:27:45.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们需要审查他们
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.28,0:27:49.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- DBS check, just to make sure they're... - Sorry?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.28,0:27:46.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 做背景调查 - 你是说…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.88,0:27:49.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}DBS调查 就是为了确保…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.12,0:27:52.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}DBS, just to make sure they're safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.12,0:27:52.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 什么？不好意思？ - DBS 为确保他们安全
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.12,0:27:53.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What? I don't know what "DBS" means.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.12,0:27:53.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我不知道DBS是什么意思
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.92,0:27:56.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- have they got a criminal record? - Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.92,0:27:56.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}DBS就是指他们有没有犯罪记录
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.32,0:27:59.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}If they have got a criminal record, what's it for?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.32,0:27:59.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}如果有犯罪记录 是因为什么事？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.60,0:28:00.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, every single year Santa breaks into about a billion houses round the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.60,0:28:00.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}每年
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.92,0:28:04.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I should imagine he has got a criminal record.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.92,0:28:04.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}圣诞老人会闯入 全世界大约十亿户人家
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.16,0:28:07.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, so we need to check that.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.16,0:28:05.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我估计他肯定有犯罪记录
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.80,0:28:07.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以我们需要查一下
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.40,0:28:11.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}How... I mean, what if he doesn't turn up?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.40,0:28:11.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而且…我是说 万一他不来怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.20,0:28:13.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, you could say that if you were running a British Airways concern.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.20,0:28:13.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}按你这种说法 如果你在经营…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.68,0:28:16.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}"There's no point buying these planes. What if the pilot doesn't turn up?"
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.68,0:28:16.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}英国航空公司 那你可以说 “没必要买这么多飞机
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.12,0:28:19.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}How long do they get with Santa?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.12,0:28:19.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 万一飞行员不来怎么办？” - 每个孩子能和圣诞老人待多久？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.44,0:28:23.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- I don't know, five minutes? - So it's 12 an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.44,0:28:22.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我不知道 五分钟？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.04,0:28:23.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那么 一小时就是十二个
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.32,0:28:24.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.64,0:28:27.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Okay, and... - Six hours a day. Twelve sixes?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.64,0:28:27.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 好的 然后呢？ - 一天六个小时 十二乘以六是？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.44,0:28:29.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}72 sets of presents.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.44,0:28:29.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 嗯 - 七十二份礼物
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.36,0:28:31.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And make sure that there's somebody in there with the child as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.36,0:28:31.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 好的 - 而且确保
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.72,0:28:34.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Who? - Either a parent...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.72,0:28:34.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}有大人陪着孩子一起进去
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.88,0:28:38.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Or an elf. - Or an elf.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.88,0:28:38.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 必须… - 要么父母任一一方 要么是小精灵
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.76,0:28:41.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So I've gotta put an advert in the local paper saying,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.76,0:28:41.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以我打算 在当地报纸上登个广告 说
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.24,0:28:45.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}"Wanted: Man or woman to dress up as an elf
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.24,0:28:45.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“招聘男性或女性扮演小精灵
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.24,0:28:46.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}for minimum wage."
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.24,0:28:46.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}按最低工资支付”
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.56,0:28:48.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No, national living wage.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.56,0:28:48.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不行 是国家生活工资
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.72,0:28:50.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So you're saying that we've gotta get a Santa,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.72,0:28:50.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以你是说 我们得找个圣诞老人
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.72,0:28:52.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}we've gotta make sure he's not a paedophile,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.72,0:28:52.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}还得确保他不是恋童癖
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.48,0:28:54.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}an elf,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.48,0:28:54.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}还有小精灵
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.80,0:28:57.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and all it means is bringing the goose hut over,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.80,0:28:57.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而这一切就意味着 把鹅棚搬过来
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.40,0:28:59.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}hosing some of the faeces out...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.40,0:28:59.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}用水冲掉一些粪便
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.40,0:29:00.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Well, actually all of them. - All of the faeces.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.40,0:29:00.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 实际上要全冲干净 - 全部冲掉
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.72,0:29:03.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Disinfected.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.72,0:29:03.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 把所有粪便都冲掉 - 所有的粪便 还要消毒
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.92,0:29:10.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}While Charlie was fully supporting my plans upstairs,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.92,0:29:10.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}当查理在楼上全力支持我的计划时
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.04,0:29:14.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Lisa was in the kitchen getting some rather unwelcome news.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.04,0:29:11.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}丽莎在厨房里
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.68,0:29:15.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}听到了一些相当不愉快的消息
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.44,0:29:16.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We're just salting them,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.44,0:29:16.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们正在给它们抹盐
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.72,0:29:18.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}to bring the moisture out and make the skin crispy when they get roasted.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.72,0:29:18.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 好的 - 这是为了逼出一点水分
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.48,0:29:22.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And when will you bring the rest in?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.48,0:29:20.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这样烤的时候 皮就会又香又脆
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.52,0:29:22.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你什么时候把剩下的拿进来？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.52,0:29:24.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The rest? They're all here.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.52,0:29:24.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}剩下的？都在这里了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.60,0:29:26.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But, no, we're not... We're just...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.60,0:29:26.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}可是 我们不是…我们只是…我想…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.44,0:29:29.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Aren't we going to have them throughout the weeks
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.44,0:29:29.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}接下来的几周直到圣诞 我们不是要
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.84,0:29:31.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}up until Christmas for lunches and dinners?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.84,0:29:31.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}一直用它们来做午餐和晚餐吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.68,0:29:33.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Do you have more geese?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.68,0:29:33.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你还有更多的鹅吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.68,0:29:35.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No, I think this is for tonight for the big banquet, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.68,0:29:35.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 还是怎么… - 不 我想这些就是今晚用的
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.88,0:29:38.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This is all of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.88,0:29:38.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 是为那场大宴会准备的 对吧？ - 这就是所有的鹅了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.96,0:29:40.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- I had 30. - This is... this is all the geese.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.96,0:29:40.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我有三十只
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.52,0:29:44.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- The whole lot's going tonight? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.52,0:29:42.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这就是…所有鹅都在这里了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.96,0:29:44.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}今晚全都用掉吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.64,0:29:49.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But I thought we could have them for lunch and dinner up until Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.64,0:29:46.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 对 - 可我以为…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.16,0:29:49.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们可以用它们来做接下来…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.04,0:29:50.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.04,0:29:50.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}一直到圣诞节
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.32,0:29:51.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.32,0:29:53.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The geese that you sent will cover us for tonight, no more.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.32,0:29:53.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你送来的那些鹅只够我们今晚用的 没有更多了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.96,0:29:59.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Reindeer, are there any reindeer near here?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.96,0:29:59.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}驯鹿 这附近有驯鹿吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.36,0:30:01.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Are there any reindeer near here?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.36,0:30:01.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这附近有驯鹿吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.92,0:30:04.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So we get a normal deer...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.92,0:30:04.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那我们找一只普通的鹿…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.36,0:30:06.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Which will freak when a kid goes near it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.36,0:30:06.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}小孩靠近 它就会受惊
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.56,0:30:08.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}How high do the fences have to be for deers?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.56,0:30:08.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}鹿的围栏得有多高？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.68,0:30:10.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Like, 6 feet, 8 feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.68,0:30:10.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 大概一米八？二米四？ - 好 那我们立个一米八的…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.40,0:30:12.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Okay, so we'd put a six-foot...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.40,0:30:14.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}看起来会像是个战俘营
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.44,0:30:13.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It'll look like a prisoner-of-war camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.00,0:30:16.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I know, I went to Stalag Luft III the other day.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.00,0:30:16.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我知道 我前几天还去过第三战俘营
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.60,0:30:21.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Which is impressive, but I'm not sure it's the right theme.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.60,0:30:19.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 挺有意思的 - 确实…令人印象深刻
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.12,0:30:21.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但我不确定这个主题是否合适
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.44,0:30:23.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Plastic animals.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.44,0:30:23.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}塑料动物
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.76,0:30:24.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That would look great.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.76,0:30:24.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那会很棒的
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.40,0:30:27.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I mean, it wouldn't, but it would be great.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.40,0:30:27.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}其实不会 但挺好
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.04,0:30:30.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's the first good idea you've had.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.04,0:30:30.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这是你到目前为止 提出的第一个好主意
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.12,0:30:34.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Later that night, Lisa decided
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.12,0:30:34.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那天晚上晚些时候 丽莎决定应该让所有的鹅肉客人
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.48,0:30:38.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}that all her geese guests should be made to share her pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.48,0:30:38.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}都来分担她的痛苦
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.32,0:30:42.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yes, and I thought all these geese would last from now
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.32,0:30:42.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是的 我原本以为这些鹅
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.28,0:30:44.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}until Christmas Day.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.28,0:30:44.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}能从现在一直用到圣诞节那天呢
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.88,0:30:47.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No, no, no. You've eaten them all tonight apparently.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.88,0:30:47.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不 显然 你们今晚就把它们全吃了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.56,0:30:52.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}As for me...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.56,0:30:52.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}至于我
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.64,0:30:58.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Charlie had eventually signed off on my grotto plan,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.64,0:30:58.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}查理最终还是批准了 我的圣诞老人小屋计划
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.00,0:31:01.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}but I couldn't start on it just yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.00,0:31:01.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但我还不能马上开始动手
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.32,0:31:03.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.32,0:31:03.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}就这样
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.48,0:31:06.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Because with winter now upon us...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.48,0:31:06.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为现在冬天已经来临…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.40,0:31:08.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Hello, cows and End Game!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.40,0:31:08.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你们好 牛牛们 还有终局！
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.80,0:31:12.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The time had come to move our four-legged residents...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.80,0:31:12.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}…是时候让我们这些四条腿的住户…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.48,0:31:13.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Sorry, cows.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.48,0:31:13.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对不起啦 牛牛们
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.84,0:31:17.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Into the warmth of their barn.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.84,0:31:17.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}…搬进温暖的牛棚里了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.20,0:31:19.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What are you doing that for? You're not boxing.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.20,0:31:19.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你这是干什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.04,0:31:21.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}He might come at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.04,0:31:21.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你不是在打拳击吧！ - 以防万一…它万一冲过来呢
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.68,0:31:23.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Good End Game, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.68,0:31:23.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}乖终局
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.12,0:31:25.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You're my friend, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.12,0:31:25.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 你是我的朋友 对不对？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.80,0:31:29.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.80,0:31:29.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这就对了！
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.00,0:31:36.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And that, my dear, is how you move sheeps.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.00,0:31:36.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}亲爱的 羊就是这么赶的
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.32,0:31:40.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Once the animals were sorted,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.32,0:31:40.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}把牲口们安顿好之后
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.40,0:31:42.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I could get cracking with my grotto.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.40,0:31:42.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我就可以开始着手我的小屋了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.20,0:31:50.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And having advertised in nearby villages for a Santa,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.20,0:31:50.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}在附近的村庄刊登了 招聘圣诞老人的广告后…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.08,0:31:52.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（圣诞老人小屋 招聘：圣诞老人（恋童癖勿扰））
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.20,0:31:54.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}a local chap had applied for the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.20,0:31:54.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（请将申请发送至该邮箱）
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.16,0:31:58.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}When I can, but I have four dogs.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.16,0:31:55.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}…一个本地人申请了这份工作
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.52,0:31:58.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}…我时不时会去当一下 但我养了四条狗
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.12,0:32:00.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And you're not a paedophile?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.12,0:32:00.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而且你不是恋童癖
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.04,0:32:01.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm not a paedophile, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.04,0:32:01.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不是恋童癖 不是
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.72,0:32:03.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.72,0:32:03.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好的
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.28,0:32:06.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}With the checks done and Santa hired,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.28,0:32:06.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}审查完毕 圣诞老人也雇好了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.04,0:32:11.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}the next job was to move the goose hut up to the pub.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.04,0:32:11.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}下一步就是把鹅棚搬到酒吧那边去
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.36,0:32:15.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And once that was done,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.36,0:32:15.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}搬好之后
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.36,0:32:19.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I could start turning it into a grotto.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.36,0:32:19.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我就可以开始把它改造成一个小屋了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.68,0:32:20.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Erm...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.88,0:32:22.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Here's my plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.88,0:32:22.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我的计划是这样的
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.24,0:32:27.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We're gonna have the "aminals" and the Nativity scene in there
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.24,0:32:27.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们要把动物们 和耶稣诞生的场景放在那边
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.60,0:32:29.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}with straw on the floor,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.60,0:32:29.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}地上铺上稻草
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.20,0:32:32.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and then in here will be Father Christmas's grotto,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.20,0:32:32.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后这里面是圣诞老人的小屋
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.40,0:32:34.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}so I'll have to carpet this
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.40,0:32:35.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以这边我得铺上地毯 这里要弄得温暖舒适
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.64,0:32:36.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and this will be snuggy.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.68,0:32:41.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And lo, the geese shall go
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.68,0:32:41.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}于是乎 鹅儿们离去
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.12,0:32:42.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and there shall be rugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.12,0:32:42.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}毯子们铺起
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.00,0:32:46.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.00,0:32:46.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.28,0:32:48.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Presents.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.28,0:32:48.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}礼物
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.84,0:32:54.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Now technically, these aren't reindeer, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.84,0:32:54.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}严格来说 这些不是驯鹿 但是…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.40,0:32:56.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.40,0:32:56.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.00,0:33:01.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And there shall be light.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.00,0:33:01.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}还要有光
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.80,0:33:05.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Elf of the week.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.80,0:33:03.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（本周小精灵 卡莱布“糖果”棒）
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.48,0:33:04.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}本周小精灵
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.56,0:33:08.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}His writing desk.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.56,0:33:08.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他的写字台
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.08,0:33:14.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Santa's weed.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.08,0:33:14.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}圣诞老人的大麻
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.68,0:33:16.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Once I'd furnished Santa's grotto
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.68,0:33:16.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（亲爱的圣诞老人 我今年很乖）
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.56,0:33:18.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and laid out the Nativity scene...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.56,0:33:18.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（圣诞节我真的 很想要一套木制火车玩具）
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.40,0:33:22.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This is amazing, look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.40,0:33:20.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我把圣诞老人的小屋布置好 把耶稣诞生的场景摆好之后…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.76,0:33:22.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}太棒了 看看这个
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.12,0:33:25.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I thought it wise to refresh my memory
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.12,0:33:28.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}…我觉得最好还是重温一下 关于圣婴耶稣诞生的故事
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.80,0:33:28.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}about the birth of the Baby Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.36,0:33:32.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So I've got myself, from the local church...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.36,0:33:32.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以我自己从当地教堂找来了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.84,0:33:34.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}a Bible.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.84,0:33:34.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}一本《圣经》
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.80,0:33:37.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And in Matthew,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.80,0:33:40.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}在《马太福音》里 它说
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.52,0:33:39.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}it says that...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.08,0:33:42.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}"Mary was pledged to be married to Joseph."
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.08,0:33:42.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“玛丽亚被许配给了约瑟”
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.64,0:33:45.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I thought they were married. Okay, they were engaged.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.64,0:33:45.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我以为他们已经结婚了 好吧 他们是订了婚
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.12,0:33:46.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}"But before they came together,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.12,0:33:46.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“可是在他们成婚以前
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.28,0:33:49.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}she was found to be with child through the Holy Spirit."
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.28,0:33:49.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}她就由圣灵怀了孕”
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.64,0:33:53.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Now, he presents that as a fact. No checking, no backup,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.64,0:33:53.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他直接把这个当作事实陈述出来 没有核查 没有证据
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.32,0:33:54.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}"She's pregnant with the Holy Spirit."
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.32,0:33:54.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}她因圣灵怀孕了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.08,0:33:59.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}"And because Joseph, her husband, was a righteous man
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.08,0:33:59.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“因为她的丈夫约瑟是个义人
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.68,0:34:02.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and did not want to expose her to public disgrace,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.68,0:34:02.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不愿意公开羞辱她
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.52,0:34:04.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}he had in mind to divorce her quietly."
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.52,0:34:04.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}就打算悄悄和她解除婚约”
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.84,0:34:05.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.84,0:34:05.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.96,0:34:09.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I never read that before.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.96,0:34:09.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我以前从没读过这段
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.64,0:34:11.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}"But after he had considered this,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.64,0:34:11.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“他正考虑这事的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.48,0:34:13.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}an angel of the Lord appeared to him in a dream and said,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.48,0:34:13.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}主的一位天使在梦中向他显现
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.84,0:34:15.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}'Joseph, son of David,
