Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.68,0:34:37.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Emmanuel, why?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.68,0:34:37.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}以马内利？为什么…
