Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.56,0:34:42.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他们为什么要用一部七十年代 色情电影的名字给孩子起名？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.76,0:34:44.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Honestly, Matthew,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.76,0:34:46.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}说真的 马太 他写东西的方式跟我一样
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.92,0:34:46.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}he writes like I do.
