Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.64,0:34:52.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}除了马太那令人费解的版本之外
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.04,0:34:54.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}there was a more immediate issue,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.04,0:34:54.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}还有一个更紧迫的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.00,0:34:58.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}as I explained to the Reverend Cooper upon his arrival.
