Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.36,0:35:24.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对我来说 一个比吉斯乐队成员的 后代是没法当作婴儿耶稣的
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.92,0:35:24.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}as the Baby Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.32,0:35:27.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So, I'd bought an alternative.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.32,0:35:27.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以我买了另一个替代品
