Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.52,0:35:49.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“管它是公元前多少年”
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.80,0:35:53.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Nought, that's the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.80,0:35:51.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那你说是什么时候？
