Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.76,0:36:00.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你知道公元前是什么意思吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.32,0:36:02.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- No, I thought it was primaeval. - "Before Christ".
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.32,0:36:02.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 不知道 我一直以为是原始时代… -“基督以前”
