Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.68,0:36:22.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I thought they were once the T. Rex,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.68,0:36:22.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我以为先是霸王龙 然后突然
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.76,0:36:25.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and then all of a sudden they was a monkey and then they come to this.
