Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.20,0:41:30.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- We're gonna be here all day. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.20,0:41:30.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我们得在这儿待一整天了 - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.92,0:41:36.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}With all the sheeps fully manicured,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.92,0:41:38.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}等所有羊都修完指甲 我们终于能回到小屋那边了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.96,0:41:38.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}we could get back to the grotto,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.76,0:41:41.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}which still needed some finishing touches,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.76,0:41:41.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那里还有些收尾工作要做
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.64,0:41:44.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}starting with my snow machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.64,0:41:44.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}先从我的造雪机开始
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.76,0:41:47.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}All right, I think this is how you do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.76,0:41:47.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好了 我觉得应该是这么用的
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.76,0:41:54.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Look at that! - That's wicked!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.76,0:41:54.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你看 - 太厉害了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.16,0:41:59.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We are not going to feature
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.16,0:41:59.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们不会登上《每日邮报》的
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.68,0:42:04.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}in The Daily Mail's annual "Shit Christmas Grotto" photo, are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.68,0:42:04.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“年度糟糕圣诞小屋照片集”吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.00,0:42:06.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, it's sticking to the trees, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.00,0:42:06.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它们粘在树上了 你看
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.04,0:42:11.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And then, to complete the Nativity scene...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.04,0:42:11.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后 来完成耶稣诞生的场景…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.64,0:42:13.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Come on, Brittany.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.64,0:42:13.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}来吧 布列塔尼
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.88,0:42:17.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Whoa! Now what do you think of this, goats?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.88,0:42:17.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}山羊们 你们觉得这个怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.16,0:42:19.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Something else to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.16,0:42:19.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}又有东西可以吃了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.40,0:42:22.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I love donkeys.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.40,0:42:22.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我喜欢驴
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.48,0:42:29.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Oh no, no. - Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.48,0:42:29.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 不 - 退后 嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.64,0:42:31.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.64,0:42:31.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}操
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.08,0:42:34.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Jesus is having a tough time, I must be honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.08,0:42:34.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}说实话 耶稣的日子不太好过
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.40,0:42:36.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Over in the Santa section of the grotto,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.40,0:42:39.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}在小屋的圣诞老人区域 我又发现了一个问题
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.92,0:42:39.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I then spotted another problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.72,0:42:41.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We're going to need a cameraman in here
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.72,0:42:41.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们需要一个摄像师在这儿
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.64,0:42:44.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}so we can film the scene of Santa with the children.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.64,0:42:44.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好让我们拍下圣诞老人 和孩子们在一起的场景
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.60,0:42:49.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But that would rather spoil the mood if you put that in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.60,0:42:49.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但如果把摄像机放在这里 那气氛就全毁了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.84,0:42:51.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I then had a brainwave,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.84,0:42:51.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后我灵机一动
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.64,0:42:55.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}which required the help of our camera assistant.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.64,0:42:55.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}需要我们的摄影助理帮忙
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.84,0:42:57.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Joey? Joey? - Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.84,0:42:57.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}乔伊！
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.68,0:42:59.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Mate.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.68,0:42:59.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.16,0:43:02.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This is a big ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.16,0:43:02.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}朋友 这事有点难办
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.76,0:43:11.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.76,0:43:11.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你是认真的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.00,0:43:18.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}An hour later,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.00,0:43:18.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}一个小时后 农夫的狗
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.16,0:43:22.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}everything was ready in The Farmer's Dog Christmas Grotto,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.16,0:43:22.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}圣诞老人小屋里的所有东西 都已经备好
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.04,0:43:24.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}even the cast of characters.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.04,0:43:24.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}连角色阵容都齐了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.96,0:43:26.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Ho, ho, ho!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.80,0:43:28.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- This looks amazing. - Santa!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.80,0:43:28.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 看起来棒极了 - 圣诞老人！
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.12,0:43:29.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Hello, little boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.12,0:43:29.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你好啊 小朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.44,0:43:31.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.44,0:43:32.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 这有待商榷 - 嗨
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.56,0:43:33.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Hi. - That's debatable.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.40,0:43:37.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}As the first of the families turned up...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.40,0:43:37.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}当第一批家庭到达时…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.48,0:43:40.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.48,0:43:40.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你好！
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.12,0:43:45.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Charlie arrived, and even he was impressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.12,0:43:45.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}…查理来了 连他都被惊到了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.40,0:43:48.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You know I had my doubts about this thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.40,0:43:48.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我之前对这玩意持怀疑态度
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.56,0:43:51.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I know, you have your doubts about everything I wanna do.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.56,0:43:51.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我知道 你对我想做的每一件事 都持怀疑态度
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.64,0:43:54.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I know. Well... But it's really good, actually!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.64,0:43:54.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我知道 嗯…但实际上 这真的很好
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.68,0:43:57.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And the business plan? 10 pounds a ticket.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.68,0:43:57.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那商业计划呢？每张票十英镑
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.12,0:44:00.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- The presents were 4 pounds. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.12,0:44:00.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 礼物花了四英镑 - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.80,0:44:04.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Father Christmas, I can't remember how much we're paying him - not much.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.80,0:44:04.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}圣诞老人 记不清 我们付给他多少钱了 反正不多
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.04,0:44:06.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We're using the camera assistant as an elf.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.04,0:44:06.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们让一个摄影助理来扮演小精灵
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.28,0:44:09.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So off your ten pounds, have you taken 20% off?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.28,0:44:09.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 所以 从这十英镑里 你算过要扣20%了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.92,0:44:11.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.92,0:44:11.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.32,0:44:14.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Why are you bringing accountancy into the festive...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.32,0:44:13.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 什么？你为什么要把会计学… - 十英镑？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.56,0:44:14.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}…扯到节日里来…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.60,0:44:16.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Off the 10, we only keep 8.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.60,0:44:16.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}十英镑里 我们只能留下八英镑
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.52,0:44:19.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Cause we have to give 20% to the government.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.52,0:44:19.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为我们要给政府20%
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.32,0:44:20.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Anyway, listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.32,0:44:20.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不管怎样 听着 这才是最大的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.32,0:44:23.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This is the biggest problem. Never mind your accountancy.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.32,0:44:23.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}先别管你的会计学了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.52,0:44:25.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What? No!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.52,0:44:26.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 什么？不！ - 我是说 为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.48,0:44:26.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.28,0:44:30.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Jesus is being tossed around like an empty pair of pyjamas!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.28,0:44:30.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}耶稣被它们像一件空睡衣一样乱扔
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.92,0:44:32.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Are you ready? Right...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.92,0:44:32.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 准备好了吗？ - 看！
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.64,0:44:34.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.64,0:44:34.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 好了 - 看！
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.92,0:44:36.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Oh my... - Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.92,0:44:36.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 不！ - 不！
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.36,0:44:39.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh! Get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.36,0:44:39.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}走开！
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.20,0:44:45.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}While the endlessly comedic goats laid waste to the grotto,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.20,0:44:45.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}当那两只永远在搞笑的山羊 把小屋搞得一团糟时
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.72,0:44:48.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}it was time for the rest of us to down tools
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.72,0:44:48.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们其他人也该放下手里的活儿
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.60,0:44:51.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and in our own Diddly Squat way,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.60,0:44:53.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}用我们迪丽斯库阿特自己的方式 来庆祝圣诞节了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.52,0:44:53.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}celebrate Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.00,0:44:58.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Out on the roads, we joined all the local farmers
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.00,0:44:58.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}在路上 我们加入了 当地所有农民的行列
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.88,0:45:02.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}who'd temporarily forgotten about Rachel Reeves
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.88,0:45:02.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他们暂时忘掉了蕾切尔里夫斯
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.04,0:45:04.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}so they could entertain the children
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.04,0:45:04.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}用他们一年一度的圣诞节拖拉机游行
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.40,0:45:07.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}with their annual Christmas tractor run.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.40,0:45:07.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}来给孩子们带来欢乐
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.00,0:45:14.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- How are you doing? - How are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.00,0:45:14.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你好吗？ - 你好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.56,0:45:16.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- How are you? - Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.56,0:45:16.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 杰里米 很高兴见到你 - 你好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.32,0:45:18.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Meanwhile, at The Farmer's Dog,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.32,0:45:19.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}与此同时 在农夫的狗 我们为所有帮助它取得成功的人
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.24,0:45:19.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}we hosted a Christmas lock-in
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.92,0:45:23.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}for all the people who'd helped us make it a success.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.92,0:45:23.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}举办了一场圣诞节内部派对
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.24,0:45:26.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Hi, guys. Help yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.24,0:45:26.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好了 各位 请自便
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.44,0:45:28.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The bar is open.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.44,0:45:28.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}酒吧开放
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.92,0:45:34.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Along with all the familiar faces...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.92,0:45:34.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}除了那些熟悉的面孔…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.36,0:45:37.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Hi!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.36,0:45:37.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}嗨！
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.00,0:45:40.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}There were Diddly Squat alumni from previous years.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.00,0:45:40.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}…还有前几季里 迪丽斯库阿特的老朋友们
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.12,0:45:43.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Look who's here! - Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.12,0:45:43.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 看谁来了 - 你好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.76,0:45:46.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Like Kevin and Ellen, the sheep people.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.76,0:45:46.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}比如凯文和艾伦 就是养羊的那两位
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.32,0:45:49.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I was reading you had shedding sheep now.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.32,0:45:49.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我听说你们养了那种会自己掉毛的羊
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.80,0:45:51.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, we've got EasyCare. One of them was so easy
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.80,0:45:51.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 对 我们养了易养羊 - 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.88,0:45:54.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}to care for it died.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.88,0:45:54.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}其中一只太好养了 结果死了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.12,0:45:58.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Even Mr "No, No, No" Tom turned up,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.12,0:45:58.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}就连那个“不不不”先生 汤姆也来了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.28,0:46:01.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}proudly announcing he was now a published author.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.28,0:46:01.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}骄傲地宣布 他现在已经是一位出版作家了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.84,0:46:04.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Is this your book? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.84,0:46:04.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这是你的书？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.04,0:46:06.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I used to go out with local groups
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.04,0:46:06.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 我以前会和当地团体一起出去
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.88,0:46:08.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and do moss walks and stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.88,0:46:08.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}做做苔藓徒步之类的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.80,0:46:10.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Fantastic. - This is great.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.80,0:46:09.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（《寻找苔藓指南》）
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.72,0:46:10.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 太棒了 - 厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.92,0:46:13.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I thought it said "A Guide to finding Moses".
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.92,0:46:13.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我以为是《寻找摩西指南》呢
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.12,0:46:20.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Lisa? Harriet's bought us a present.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.12,0:46:20.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}丽莎 哈丽特给我们买了礼物
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.48,0:46:21.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.48,0:46:21.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不会吧
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.68,0:46:23.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Did you make that? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.68,0:46:23.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 这是你做的吗？ - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.20,0:46:24.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- You made it? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.20,0:46:24.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你做的？ - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.40,0:46:26.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Thanks, Harriet. - It hangs that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.40,0:46:26.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 谢谢你 哈丽特！ - 要这样挂
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.04,0:46:29.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's Christmassy and violent.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.04,0:46:29.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}又圣诞又暴力
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.48,0:46:33.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And my sister and my dad shot them all and killed that pheasant.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.48,0:46:33.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我姐姐和我爸把它们全打下来了 还打死了那只野鸡
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.68,0:46:36.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Aw, that is brilliant!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.68,0:46:36.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}太厉害了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.72,0:46:38.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Where should we hang it? - You don't have to put it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.72,0:46:38.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们挂哪儿？肯定有地方可以
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.40,0:46:40.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- We do. - We do.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.40,0:46:39.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你不一定非要挂起来
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.56,0:46:40.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 不 我们要挂 - 我们要挂
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.88,0:46:43.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Hi, Nick. You all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.88,0:46:43.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 嗨 尼克 你好吗？ - 对 圣诞快乐
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.36,0:46:44.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- You go like that. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.36,0:46:44.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那样做…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.72,0:46:46.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- You pick it up with your mouth. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.72,0:46:46.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 好 - 然后你用嘴把它捡起来
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.44,0:46:49.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You'd have to be Mick Jagger to get that.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.44,0:46:47.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 什么？ - 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.64,0:46:49.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我得是米克贾格尔才能做到
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.16,0:46:52.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- No, hang on. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.16,0:46:52.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不 等等
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.68,0:46:54.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Right, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.68,0:46:54.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好的
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.04,0:46:55.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好了 所以…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.04,0:46:56.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No, no, no, not on your knees.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.04,0:46:56.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不 不能跪着
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.76,0:46:58.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No hands and no knees.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.76,0:46:58.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不能用手 也不能用膝盖
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.92,0:47:02.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Ha, ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.04,0:47:07.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Are you ready, Gerald? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.04,0:47:06.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}准备好了吗 杰拉德？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.64,0:47:08.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.08,0:47:10.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- All right, 101, yeah? Double out. - Who can do maths?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.08,0:47:10.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好的 一零一 对吧？双倍出分
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.00,0:47:11.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 在场谁数学好？ - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.08,0:47:13.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- I'm quite good at darts maths. - Nothing in!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.08,0:47:13.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我飞镖算分还行 - 没有！
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.08,0:47:15.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}There's no light on the dartboard either, I can't see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.08,0:47:15.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}飞镖靶上也没灯 我看不见
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.92,0:47:17.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You're getting closer every time!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.92,0:47:17.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你每次都比上一次更接近了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.80,0:47:20.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You should get your head torch and put it on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.80,0:47:20.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你应该把你的头灯拿来 照着它
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.24,0:47:21.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.24,0:47:21.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 好！ - 好！
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.80,0:47:24.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- That was good. - What's the prize anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.80,0:47:24.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 那不错 - 奖品是什么来着？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.36,0:47:25.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'll buy you a drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.36,0:47:25.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我请你喝一杯
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.80,0:47:27.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's a free bar.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.80,0:47:27.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这是免费酒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.04,0:47:28.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I know, that's my point.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.04,0:47:28.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我知道 我就是这个意思
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.80,0:47:38.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Could you do that? - Absolutely zero chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.80,0:47:38.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你能做到吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.28,0:47:42.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I couldn't. Absolutely ridiculous. I was on my hands and knees.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.28,0:47:39.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 绝对不可能 - 我做不到
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.96,0:47:42.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}太荒唐了 我刚才都跪在地上了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.96,0:47:46.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Come on, Charles. I'll do health and safety for ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.96,0:47:44.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}来吧 查尔斯
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.24,0:47:46.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我来帮你做健康和安全检查
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.20,0:47:47.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, Jesus!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.20,0:47:48.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}天哪 等等
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.60,0:47:48.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Hang on...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.28,0:47:51.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No way! That's not gonna happen!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.28,0:47:51.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不可能！绝对做不到
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.36,0:47:54.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- No, that's 21. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.36,0:47:53.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不 那是21
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.92,0:47:54.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.84,0:47:57.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- You didn't get 12, you got 9. - I got 7 and 5.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.84,0:47:57.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你不是12分 是九分 - 我得了七分还有五分
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.28,0:47:59.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You got 9, 7 and 5.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.28,0:47:59.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你得了九分、七分和五分 - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.20,0:48:04.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}As the drink flowed and the fire roared...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.20,0:48:04.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}随着酒越喝越多 篝火越烧越旺…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.36,0:48:16.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}There was no doubt we'd made a really good pub...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.36,0:48:16.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}毫无疑问 我们确实开了 一家很棒的酒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.52,0:48:22.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But in the New Year,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.52,0:48:26.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但我知道 在新的一年里 我们也必须经营好一个很棒的农场
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.80,0:48:26.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I knew we had to make a really good farm as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.72,0:48:35.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's gonna feel weird leaving England.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.72,0:48:33.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（下集预告）
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.80,0:48:35.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}离开英格兰感觉会很奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.72,0:48:39.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- This is what abroad is like. - Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.72,0:48:39.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}原来国外是这个样子
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.84,0:48:41.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Bloody hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.84,0:48:41.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}天哪！
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.40,0:48:43.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This is the future of farming.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.40,0:48:43.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这是农业的未来
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.08,0:48:44.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Holy shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.08,0:48:44.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}天啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.84,0:48:47.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This is just, like, my mind is in overdrive right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.84,0:48:47.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这简直…我的大脑现在超负荷运转了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.92,0:48:49.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's about to blow up.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.92,0:48:49.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它要爆炸了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.68,0:49:19.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}字幕翻译：匡思颖
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.76,0:49:21.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}创意监督 张珺怡
